        "attack": "普攻造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。被动 <#ff9028ff>决斗之舞<>：每<#ffb900ff>3秒<>，命中敌方英雄会亮出一处<#ff9028ff>破绽<>，再命中英雄即刺中：<#f5f5f5ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>10% 攻击力<> + <#f5f5f5ff>4%<>最大生命值的<#f5f5f5ff>真实伤害<>，回复<#6aff55ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#6aff55ff>15% 攻击力<>生命值，<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移速+60%<>（渐弱）。",
