      "league_fiddlesticks": {
        "name": "Fiddlesticks",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>A Harmless Scarecrow<>: after <#ffb900ff>3s<> without acting he poses as a scarecrow; his next basic attack or <#ff9028ff>Reap<> <#ef5350ff>fears<> the champions it hits for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "skill": "Fiddlesticks sends a crow at his target, dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>fearing<> it for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>. Double damage to a champion already under crowd control.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Reap<> first: <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> in the target area, <#ef5350ff>slowing<> by 40% for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<> and <#ef5350ff>silencing<> champions in its centre for as long. Then he channels for <#ffb900ff>2s<>, draining nearby enemies for <#a974ffff>178<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>136% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> in total, and heals <#6aff55ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>64%<> per champion drained (<#6aff55ff>16<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>16%<> per minion or monster).",
        "ult": "Fiddlesticks channels for <#ffb900ff>1s<>, then teleports to the target area. A murder of crows surrounds him for <#ffb900ff>5s<>, dealing <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to nearby enemies every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>; champions caught as he lands are <#ef5350ff>feared<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>. Crowd control interrupts the channel."
      },
      "league_kayle": {
        "name": "Kayle",
        "attack": "Attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> + <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Zealous<>: each attack grants <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>6% attack speed<> (5 stacks); at 5 she is <#ff9028ff>Exalted<>: <#ffffffff>10% Move Speed<>. <#ffb900ff>Level 5<> <#ff9028ff>Arisen<>: <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:range_0><#ff86c2ff>ranged<>. <#ffb900ff>Level 8<> <#ff9028ff>Aflame<>: Exalted attacks launch a fire wave, <#a974ffff>20<> + <#a974ffff>25% AP<> magic damage. <#ffb900ff>Level 12<> <#ff9028ff>Transcendent<>: always Exalted, longer range.",
        "skill": "Kayle fires a celestial sword that stops on the first enemy and bursts: <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by <#ffb900ff>30%<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<> and <#ffb900ff>15%<> less <#ffdd8eff>Armor<> and <#88ccffff>Magic Resist<> for <#ffb900ff>4s<> to the enemies around.",
        "skill2": "Kayle hurls starfire for <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, plus <#ffb900ff>3%<> of a champion's max health as <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>; from level 8 it explodes around the target. Every <#ffb900ff>12s<> it also casts <#ff9028ff>Celestial Blessing<>: Kayle and an allied champion nearby heal <#6aff55ff>60<> + <#6aff55ff>30% Ability Power<> and gain <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>25% Move Speed<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>.",
        "ult": "In a fight, a crowd-controlled allied champion nearby becomes <#ffb900ff>immune to damage<> and crowd control for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> at once; with none, Kayle does when two or more enemy champions close in on her. Then swords fall around them for <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>."
      },
      "league_ahri": {
        "name": "Ahri",
        "attack": "Basic attacks fire a fox-magic orb for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Essence Theft<>: each spell cast that hits an enemy grants a charge; at <#ffb900ff>3<> charges her next spell restores <#6aff55ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8% Ability Power<> <#6aff55ff>health<> for every enemy it hits.",
        "skill": "Ahri's orb flies out and back, dealing <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies it passes each way; the return ignores <#88ccffff>magic resistance<>. Also <#ff9028ff>Fox-Fire<> (<#ffb900ff>9s<> cooldown): <#ffb900ff>3<> fox-fires seek nearby enemies (charmed champions first), each dealing <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; she gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>40% Move Speed<>, decaying over <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "skill2": "Ahri blows a kiss that deals <#a974ffff>75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to the first enemy champion hit and <#ef5350ff>charms<> it for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>, making it walk toward her. It takes <#ffb900ff>15%<> more damage for <#ffb900ff>2s<>.",
        "ult": "Up to <#ffb900ff>3<> casts in a row; one comes back every <#ffb900ff>25s<>. Each cast Ahri dashes (away from an enemy champion that is too close, otherwise toward her target), then fires <#ffb900ff>3<> essence bolts at nearby enemies, champions first, each dealing <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>."
      },
      "league_morgana": {
        "name": "Morgana",
        "attack": "Basic attacks hurl a bolt of shadow that deals <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Soul Siphon<>: her spells heal her for about 15% of the damage they deal to champions.",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>Dark Binding<> flies through minions and monsters, dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to every enemy it passes, and stops on the first enemy champion, <#ef5350ff>rooting<> it for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. Every <#ffb900ff>12s<> it also leaves <#ff9028ff>Tormented Shadow<> under that champion: <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> over <#ffb900ff>4s<>.",
        "skill2": "Cast at an enemy champion: <#ff9028ff>Black Shield<> gives a nearby allied champion a <#e8d44dff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% Ability Power<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> for <#ffb900ff>5s<>; while it holds they are <#ef5350ff>immune to crowd control<>. With no ally nearby she shields herself.",
        "ult": "Morgana chains every nearby enemy champion, dealing <#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> them by 20%, and gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>20% Move Speed<>. Enemies that move too far away break free. After <#ffb900ff>3s<>, champions still chained take the damage again and are <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>."
      },
      "league_lucian": {
        "name": "Lucian",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Lightslinger<>: after each ability his next attack fires twice; the second shot deals <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50% AD<> (100% to minions and monsters). <#ff9028ff>Vigilance<>: when a nearby enemy champion is immobilized, his next 2 attacks deal an extra <#f5f5f5ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% AD<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>.",
        "skill": "Lucian fires a beam of light through his target, dealing <#ff9028ff>65<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>130% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to every enemy in the line.",
        "skill2": "A dash: away from an enemy champion on him, a hop back when an enemy is in range, else toward his target until it is in range. Then <#ff9028ff>Ardent Blaze<> bursts on the first enemy hit for <#f5f5f5ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60% AD<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<> and marks them for <#ffb900ff>6s<>; meanwhile each hit gives him <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>25% move speed<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>. His next 2 attacks both fire twice.",
        "ult": "Lucian stands and fires <#ffb900ff>20<> shots over <#ffb900ff>3s<>, each at the nearest enemy champion (through minions), dealing <#ff9028ff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. A stun, root, knock-up or other crowd control, or his death, ends it."
      },
      "league_briar": {
        "name": "Briar",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Crimson Curse<>: attacks and abilities apply a <#ff9028ff>bleed<> that deals <#ff9028ff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>18% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> over <#ffb900ff>5s<> and heals Briar <#6aff55ff>6<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>6% AD<>; her attacks add at most <#ffb900ff>1<> stack a second.",
        "skill": "Briar leaps onto her target (champions first) for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, <#ef5350ff>stunning<> it for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> and cutting its armor and magic resist <#ffb900ff>10%<>, then enters <#ff9028ff>Blood Frenzy<> for <#ffb900ff>5s<>: <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>40% Attack Speed<>, <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>20% Move Speed<>, splashing attacks. <#ffb900ff>2s<> in, her next attack is <#ff9028ff>Snack Attack<>: <#ff9028ff>4%<> of the target's max health more and a <#6aff55ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>20% AD<> heal.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Chilling Scream<>: Briar charges for <#ffb900ff>1s<>, taking <#ffb900ff>15%<> less damage and healing <#6aff55ff>24<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>16% AD<>, then screams forward for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, <#ef5350ff>slowing<> by <#ffb900ff>80%<> and <#ef5350ff>knocking back<>; champions knocked back are <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>Certain Death<>: Briar kicks her hemolith, marking the first champion hit (it passes minions), and flies to it. Landing deals <#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> around her and <#ef5350ff>fears<> other enemies for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>. For <#ffb900ff>6s<> she is in <#ff9028ff>Hemomania<>: Blood Frenzy plus <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>20 armor<> and magic resist, <#6aff55ff>10% life steal<> and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>25% more Move Speed<>."
      },
      "league_riven": {
        "name": "Riven",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Runic Blade<>: each spell (<#ff9028ff>Broken Wings<> every cast, <#ff9028ff>Valor<>, <#ff9028ff>Ki Burst<>, <#ff9028ff>Blade of the Exile<>) grants a rune, up to <#ffb900ff>3<>, for <#ffb900ff>6s<>; each basic attack spends one to deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35% AD<> bonus <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "skill": "Riven lunges at her target and slashes, dealing <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>45% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies around her. <#ffb900ff>3<> charges, one back every <#ffb900ff>4s<>; the third cast within <#ffb900ff>4s<> is a leap that <#ef5350ff>knocks up<> enemies around her landing for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Valor<>: Riven dashes to her target and gains a <#e8d44dff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70% AD<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>. On arrival she casts <#ff9028ff>Ki Burst<>, dealing <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies around her and <#ef5350ff>stunning<> them for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>.",
        "ult": "Starts when an enemy champion is near her and lasts <#ffb900ff>15s<>: <#ffb900ff>20%<> more AD, longer attack range and <#ffb900ff>25%<> larger <#ff9028ff>Broken Wings<> and <#ff9028ff>Ki Burst<>. After <#ffb900ff>5s<> she fires <#ff9028ff>Wind Slash<> at an enemy champion near her, dealing <#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> + <#ff9028ff>8% max health<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies in a line."
      },
      "league_vayne": {
        "name": "Vayne",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Night Hunter<>: <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>8% Move Speed<> while an enemy champion is near. <#ff9028ff>Silver Bolts<>: every <#ffb900ff>3<>rd hit in a row within <#ffb900ff>3.5s<> (attacks and abilities) deals <#f5f5f5ff>50<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<> more, plus <#f5f5f5ff>7%<> of a champion's max health.",
        "skill": "Vayne tumbles: away from an enemy champion on her, a hop back when an enemy is in range, else toward her target until it is in range. Her next attack within <#ffb900ff>7s<> deals <#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> more.",
        "skill2": "A heavy bolt from her great crossbow deals <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to an enemy champion and <#ef5350ff>knocks it back<>; where it lands it takes <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> more and is <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "ult": "For <#ffb900ff>8s<> Vayne gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% AD<>, her ability cooldowns are <#ffb900ff>50%<> shorter, <#ff9028ff>Tumble<> makes her <#ffb900ff>invisible<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<> and Night Hunter's speed is <#ffb900ff>3x<>. A champion killed by her own hit meanwhile resets Final Hour to <#ffb900ff>8s<>."
      },
      "league_akali": {
        "name": "Akali",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Assassin's Mark<>: after a spell hits an enemy champion, for <#ffb900ff>4s<> her next attack has <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:range_0><#ff86c2ff>double range<> and deals <#a974ffff>54<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% Ability Power<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; meanwhile she has <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>30% Move Speed<>.",
        "skill": "Akali throws kunai in a cone, dealing <#a974ffff>65<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>76% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> plus <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; enemies at the tip are <#ef5350ff>slowed by 50%<>. <#ff9028ff>Combo E Q A<>: within <#ffb900ff>2s<> of Shuriken Flip's dash landing on a champion, she flings the <#ff9028ff>Assassin's Mark<> kama right after the kunai.",
        "skill2": "Akali flips back and throws a shuriken that deals <#a974ffff>54<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>54% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to the first enemy hit and marks it; <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> later she dashes to it for <#a974ffff>97<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>97% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. Near an enemy champion she also casts <#ff9028ff>Twilight Shroud<> (<#ffb900ff>18s<> cooldown) on landing: smoke, <#ef5350ff>invisible<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<> and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>40% Move Speed<>, decaying.",
        "ult": "Akali dashes through the target champion: <#a974ffff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies in her path. <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> later she dashes through it again (or a nearby champion) for <#a974ffff>86<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>43% AP<>, +<#ffb900ff>25%<> per champion hit in between (up to +<#ffb900ff>200%<>). <#ff9028ff>Combo R E E R<>: Shuriken Flip's dash landing on a champion in between fires the second dash at once."
      },
      "league_nami": {
        "name": "Nami",
        "attack": "Basic attacks fire a bolt of water that deals <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Surging Tides<>: allied champions her spells reach gain <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>20% Move Speed<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>Ebb and Flow<>: water hits an enemy for <#a974ffff>65<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, bounces to a nearby allied champion, healing <#6aff55ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35% Ability Power<>, then to another enemy champion near that ally for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% Ability Power<>. <#ff9028ff>Tidecaller's Blessing<>: the healed ally gains 15% attack and Ability Power for <#ffb900ff>4s<>; enemies hit are <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by 25%.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Aqua Prison<>: Nami throws a bubble at an enemy (champions first). Where it lands, enemies take <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and are trapped and <#ef5350ff>knocked up<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>.",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>Tidal Wave<>: a huge wave rolls toward an enemy champion, dealing <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies in its path, <#ef5350ff>knocking them up<> for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> them by 60% for <#ffb900ff>2s<> (<#ffb900ff>3s<> once it has rolled far). Allied champions it passes gain double <#ff9028ff>Surging Tides<>."
      },
      "league_veigar": {
        "name": "Veigar",
        "attack": "Basic attacks fire a dark bolt dealing <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Phenomenal Evil Power<>: every spell hit on an enemy champion permanently grants <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>1 Ability Power<>; every unit killed by <#ff9028ff>Baleful Strike<> +1, every champion he kills +5. Lost on death.",
        "skill": "Veigar unleashes a bolt of dark energy that deals <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to the first <#ffb900ff>two<> enemies hit.",
        "skill2": "Veigar twists space round an enemy champion: <#ffb900ff>0.4s<> later a cage forms for <#ffb900ff>3s<>, <#ef5350ff>stunning<> each enemy that touches it for <#ffb900ff>1s<> (once each). Then <#ff9028ff>Dark Matter<> falls on its centre for <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "ult": "Veigar blasts an enemy champion with primal magic for <#a974ffff>160<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, +<#ffb900ff>25%<> for each spell hit he landed on champions in a row before it (each within <#ffb900ff>4s<> of the last), up to +<#ffb900ff>100%<>."
      },
      "league_jax": {
        "name": "Jax",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Relentless Assault<>: each attack grants <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>7% Attack Speed<> for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>, up to <#ffb900ff>8<> stacks that fall off one by one. Every <#ffb900ff>third<> attack within <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> deals <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "skill": "Jax leaps to his target for <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Empower<> (<#ffb900ff>5s<> cooldown): when ready, his next attack or Leap Strike deals <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% Ability Power<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "skill2": "Jax takes a defensive stance for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> while he keeps fighting: he dodges all basic attacks and takes <#ffb900ff>25%<> less damage from abilities. Then he strikes nearby enemies for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>stunning<> them for <#ffb900ff>1s<>; champions also take <#f5f5f5ff>4% of their max health<> as <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>.",
        "ult": "Jax slams his lamppost down for <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>150% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around him. If he hits a champion he gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>40 armor<> and magic resist for <#ffb900ff>8s<>, <#ffdd8eff>+15<> per extra champion hit; meanwhile every <#ffb900ff>second<> attack deals the passive's bonus magic damage."
      },
      "league_diana": {
        "name": "Diana",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#a974ffff>Moonsilver Blade<>: every <#ffb900ff>third<> attack cleaves enemies around its target for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; after each spell she gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>40% Attack Speed<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "skill": "<#a974ffff>Crescent Strike<>: Diana hurls a crescent (at a nearby enemy champion first) that deals <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to every enemy on its path and afflicts them with <#a974ffff>Moonlight<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "skill2": "<#a974ffff>Lunar Rush<>: dash to the target for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; with <#a974ffff>Moonlight<> up she dashes again at once (champions first). <#a974ffff>Pale Cascade<> (every <#ffb900ff>10s<>): on arrival a <#e8d44dff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% AP<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> and three orbs that hit nearby enemies for <#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30% AP<> each; after the third the shield comes again.",
        "ult": "<#a974ffff>Moonfall<>: Diana draws nearby enemy champions to her and <#ef5350ff>slows<> them by <#ffb900ff>40%<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. <#ffb900ff>1s<> later the moon crashes on her for <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around her, <#ffb900ff>+35%<> for each champion pulled beyond the first (up to <#ffb900ff>+70%<>)."
      },
      "league_taric": {
        "name": "Taric",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Bravado<>: after a spell, his next <#ffb900ff>2<> attacks within <#ffb900ff>4s<> gain <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>100% Attack Speed<>, deal <#a974ffff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20% AP<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>3% max Health<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, cut his basic cooldowns and add a <#ff9028ff>Starlight's Touch<> stack.",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>Dazzle<>: Taric projects a beam of starlight at an enemy. After <#ffb900ff>0.75s<> it bursts, dealing <#a974ffff>95<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% AP<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>2% max Health<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>stunning<> enemies on the line for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Starlight's Touch<>: spends every stack (max <#ffb900ff>3<>; one every <#ffb900ff>5s<> and per Bravado hit) to heal him and nearby allied champions for <#6aff55ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12% AP<> per stack. <#ff9028ff>Bastion<> (every <#ffb900ff>12s<>): an ally beside him gets a <#e8d44dff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% AP<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>15 Armor<> and is linked: his spells also go off around that ally.",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>Cosmic Radiance<>: as a fight begins Taric calls down the heavens; after <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> he and nearby allied champions (also around his linked ally) are <#e8d44dff>invulnerable<> for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>."
      },
      "league_tristana": {
        "name": "Tristana",
        "attack": "Basic attacks fire a cannonball for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Draw a Bead<>: <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:range_0><#ff86c2ff>attack range<> +<#ffb900ff>4.5%<> at levels <#ffb900ff>3, 6, 9 and 12<>. <#ff9028ff>Explosive Charge<>: enemies her basic attacks kill explode, dealing <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies around.",
        "skill": "Tristana throws a charge on the target that explodes after <#ffb900ff>4s<>, dealing <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> around it; each of her hits adds <#ffb900ff>25%<>, and the <#ffb900ff>4th<> detonates it at once. <#ff9028ff>Rapid Fire<>: she also gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>80% attack speed<> for <#ffb900ff>7s<>.",
        "skill2": "When her cannonball hits an enemy champion whose charge holds <#ffb900ff>2<>+ stacks, Tristana jumps onto him; firing with an enemy champion on top of her, she jumps away. Landing deals <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> around her and <#ef5350ff>slows<> by 40% for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. Cooldown <#ffb900ff>18s<>, reset when she kills an enemy champion or detonates a full charge on one.",
        "ult": "Tristana fires a massive cannonball at an enemy champion (one close to her first), dealing <#ff9028ff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to it and the enemies around, <#ef5350ff>knocking them back<> and <#ef5350ff>stunning<> them for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> where they land."
      },
      "league_fiora": {
        "name": "Fiora",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Duelist's Dance<>: every <#ffb900ff>3s<> her hit on an enemy champion reveals a <#ff9028ff>Vital<>; her next champion hit strikes it for <#f5f5f5ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>10% AD<> + <#f5f5f5ff>4%<> of max health as <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>, healing her <#6aff55ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#6aff55ff>15% AD<> and granting <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>60% Move Speed<> (decaying).",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>Lunge<>: Fiora dashes at an enemy (champions first) and stabs for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Bladework<> (every <#ffb900ff>8s<>): her next two attacks gain <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>50% Attack Speed<>; the first <#ef5350ff>slows by 30%<>, the second critically strikes for <#ff9028ff>160% AD<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Riposte<>: Fiora parries for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<> (every hit deals her 1 damage, immune to crowd control), then stabs forward for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies in a line. The first enemy champion is <#ef5350ff>slowed by 50%<>, or <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<> if she parried any damage.",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>Grand Challenge<>: reveals <#ffb900ff>4<> <#ff9028ff>Vitals<> on an enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>8s<>, grants <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>20% Move Speed<> and starts <#ff9028ff>Bladework<>. Each of her champion hits strikes one and <#ffb900ff>halves Q's and W's cooldowns<>. Striking all 4, or the target dying after one is struck, leaves a <#6aff55ff>Victory Zone<> healing allies in it <#6aff55ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#6aff55ff>24% AD<> per second for <#ffb900ff>3s<>."
      },
      "league_fizz": {
        "name": "Fizz",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and make the target bleed for <#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>18% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> over <#ffb900ff>3s<> (stacking). Passive <#ff9028ff>Nimble Fighter<>: Fizz takes <#ffffffff>12%<> less damage from basic attacks.",
        "skill": "<#a974ffff>Urchin Strike<>: Fizz dashes through the target, dealing <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> plus <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>65% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and the bleed. <#a974ffff>Seastone Trident<> (every <#ffb900ff>6s<>): his next basic attack or Urchin Strike deals <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% AP<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; if it kills the target the cooldown drops to <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "skill2": "<#a974ffff>Playful / Trickster<>: Fizz vaults onto his trident for <#ffb900ff>0.63s<> (hits deal him 1, immune to crowd control), then slams down on the nearest enemy, dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around him and <#ef5350ff>slowing by 40%<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. With enemy champions near he waits (up to <#ffb900ff>1s<>) and vaults the moment he is hit, dodging what follows.",
        "ult": "<#a974ffff>Chum the Waters<>: Fizz throws a fish that sticks to the first enemy champion and slows it; <#ffb900ff>2s<> later a shark bursts up under it, <#ef5350ff>knocking up<> nearby enemies for <#ffb900ff>1s<> and dealing <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. Farther fish, bigger shark: <#a974ffff>150/220/300<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70/90/110% AP<>, <#ef5350ff>slow 40/60/80%<>. A miss calls the big shark where the fish lands."
      },
      "league_shaco": {
        "name": "Shaco",
        "attack": "Dagger stabs. Passive <#ff9028ff>Backstab<>: attacks on crowd-controlled enemy champions deal <#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% AD<> bonus <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Two-Shiv Poison<>: every <#ffb900ff>8s<> his next attack throws a shiv instead, dealing <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> by 30%.",
        "skill": "Shaco vanishes and blinks behind his target, <#ffb900ff>invisible for 1.5s<>. His next attack is a backstab that <#ff9028ff>always critically strikes<>: <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>85% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, doubled by the crit.",
        "skill2": "Shaco throws a Jack-in-the-Box at an enemy's feet. It springs open, <#ef5350ff>fearing<> enemy champions around it for <#ffb900ff>1s<> (minions and monsters <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>), then fires at every enemy nearby every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> for <#ffb900ff>5s<>, dealing <#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> per shot.",
        "ult": "Shaco briefly vanishes and a clone appears behind an enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>5s<>, backstabbing it whenever Shaco attacks for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. When it ends or the target dies it explodes for <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, releasing three mini boxes that <#ef5350ff>fear<> nearby enemies."
      },
      "league_caitlyn": {
        "name": "Caitlyn",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Headshot<>: every <#ffb900ff>6<>th shot deals <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>180% AD<>; a trapped champion within <#ffb900ff>1.5x<> <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:range_0>range is shot first, +<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40% AD<>. <#ff9028ff>90 Caliber Net<>: an enemy champion on her gets a net instead: <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60% AD<>, a <#ef5350ff>50% slow<>; she hops back and her next shot is a Headshot (<#ffb900ff>12s<> cooldown).",
        "skill": "After aiming, Caitlyn fires a piercing round at the spot she locked (an enemy champion first; he can step aside): <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to the first enemy hit, <#ffb900ff>60%<> of it to the others.",
        "skill2": "Caitlyn throws traps at an enemy champion (<#ffb900ff>3<> charges, one every <#ffb900ff>12s<>): the first at his feet, the others spread between them, lasting <#ffb900ff>8s<>. The first enemy champion to step on it is <#ef5350ff>rooted<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> and Caitlyn headshots him.",
        "ult": "Caitlyn lines up a shot on an enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>1s<> (crowd control breaks it), then fires: the first enemy champion in the bullet's path takes <#ff9028ff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>."
      },
      "league_nocturne": {
        "name": "Nocturne",
        "attack": "Blade strikes. Passive <#ff9028ff>Umbra Blades<>: every <#ffb900ff>12s<> or every <#ffb900ff>4th<> attack, his attack cleaves all nearby enemies for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and heals him for <#6aff55ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#6aff55ff>20% AP<> per enemy hit.",
        "skill": "Nocturne throws a shadow blade, dealing <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>85% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies in its path and leaving a Dusk Trail for <#ffb900ff>5s<>; enemy champions hit leave a trail too. On a trail he gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>25% Move Speed<> and <#ff9028ff>15% AD<>.",
        "skill2": "Nocturne tethers his target for <#ffb900ff>2s<>, dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>120% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; if it is still near at the end it is <#ef5350ff>feared<> for <#ffb900ff>1.33s<> and he chases with <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>40% Move Speed<>. He also raises <#ff9028ff>Shroud of Darkness<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>: ability damage drops to 1 and he is immune to crowd control; if he is hit meanwhile he gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>40% attack speed<> for <#ffb900ff>5s<>.",
        "ult": "Darkness falls: every allied champion turns <#ffb900ff>invisible for 3s<> (enemies see only what is next to them), and Nocturne flies at an enemy champion, dealing <#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> on landing. He is immune to crowd control in flight."
      },
      "league_blitzcrank": {
        "name": "Blitzcrank",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; while Static Field is off cooldown, lightning strikes the target <#ffb900ff>1s<> later for <#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. Passive <#e8d44dff>Mana Barrier<>: when surrounded or crowd-controlled he gains a <#e8d44dff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% AP<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> (<#ffb900ff>60s<> cooldown).",
        "skill": "Blitzcrank fires his hand at the first enemy champion in a line (it passes minions), dealing <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>stunning<> it and pulling it to him.",
        "skill2": "An uppercut dealing <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <#ef5350ff>knocking up<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>. <#ff9028ff>Overdrive<> (every <#ffb900ff>15s<>): when enemy champions come near he gains +40% decaying move speed and +25% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>4s<>, then is <#ef5350ff>slowed by 25%<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "ult": "Blitzcrank discharges, dealing <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to nearby enemies and <#ef5350ff>silencing<> enemy champions for <#ffb900ff>1s<>. Used once a fight is on; afterwards the attacks' lightning stops until Static Field is off cooldown."
      },
      "league_camille": {
        "name": "Camille",
        "attack": "Blade kicks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Adaptive Defenses<>: every <#ffb900ff>10s<> her kick on an enemy champion grants a <#e8d44dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#e8d44dff>60% AD<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. <#ff9028ff>Precision Protocol<> (every <#ffb900ff>7s<>): her next kick deals <#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% AD<> more and grants <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>Move Speed<>; the next kick after a <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> charge deals double the bonus, <#f5f5f5ff>40%<> as <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>.",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>Tactical Sweep<>: Camille winds up and slices in a cone toward her target for <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Enemies hit by the outer edge take <#ff9028ff>5%<> of their max health more and are <#ef5350ff>slowed by 80%<> (decaying over 2s); she heals <#6aff55ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#6aff55ff>20% AD<> per enemy champion hit by the edge.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Hookshot<>: Camille hooks a minion, monster or tower near an enemy champion (never a champion) and is pulled to it, then dashes at a nearby enemy champion, dealing <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> around her, <#ef5350ff>stunning<> it for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> and gaining <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>30% Attack Speed<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>. Outnumbered, she hooks one away from enemies and dashes off instead.",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>The Hextech Ultimatum<>: Camille leaps onto an enemy champion (immune to damage and crowd control in the air), knocks the others away and raises a fixed field where she lands for <#ffb900ff>3s<>: the target cannot dash or walk out of it, and she stays inside too. Her kicks on champions meanwhile deal <#f5f5f5ff>10<> + <#f5f5f5ff>2%<> of max health as <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>."
      }
    },
